summary:

Agents write code fast now, and the bottleneck has moved to whoever has to understand it. This survey maps where practitioners and researchers converged in 2026, from cognitive debt to literate explainers and micro-worlds, with pre-read and post-read quizzes to test your own understanding. Where does your review practice sit in the conversation?
---
